# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# This matters more than it looks. The handoff plan depends on officers editing
# files directly on github.com, and the web editor always writes LF. Without
# this, edits made on Windows and edits made in the browser fight each other
# and produce diffs where every line appears changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
